{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To the Carrot is a cozy logic puzzle about the dream of one little snail who is too slow to reach the cherished carrot on its own. But it\u2019s not that simple, because the magical forest has its own rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t control the snail directly, but use the unique abilities of forest creatures: some push, some pull, some open the way. You will need to show attention and patience, because every creature is a key to the solution.<br> <br><strong>What awaits you:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cute pixel art and relaxing atmospheric music that immerses you in the magical forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Friendly creatures, each with its own unique role and ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Intuitive and unhurried gameplay without timers or restrictions - step by step at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Gradually increasing difficulty of levels that require clear tactics and calculation to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Over 100 original levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Don\u2019t be afraid of mistakes - they lead to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033180/extras/171fa69504902583ea0ae7b89574acca.poster.avif?t=1773151212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033180/extras/171fa69504902583ea0ae7b89574acca.webm?t=1773151212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you appreciate coziness, kindness, and unhurried games, and want to puzzle over clever challenges, then go ahead! To the carrot!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033180?t=1773151212","background_raw":